{"version":1,"content":"<p>樂隊Supper Moment推出新歌《直至矛盾瓦解》，是他們相隔一年半再推出廣東歌。</p><p>新歌由Supper Moment作曲、小克填詞，首次邀得影帝任達華親自監製兼執導MV，華哥更落場飾演其中一角，身兼監製、導演與演員。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:06.303929+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T13:58:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.723830+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.723830+00:00","content_hash":"8a33cff53d2bf0614535f7fa1738e8e2d0b10b09f7f4490c231e5d31a8cc817e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}